{
  "sn55.21:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 55.21 ",
  "sn55.21:0.2": "3. Saraṇānivagga ",
  "sn55.21:0.3": "Paṭhamamahānāmasutta ",
  "sn55.21:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn55.21:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ nigrodhārāme. ",
  "sn55.21:1.3": "Atha kho mahānāmo sakko yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho mahānāmo sakko bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn55.21:1.4": "“idaṁ, bhante, kapilavatthu iddhañceva phītañca bāhujaññaṁ ākiṇṇamanussaṁ sambādhabyūhaṁ. ",
  "sn55.21:1.5": "So khvāhaṁ, bhante, bhagavantaṁ vā payirupāsitvā manobhāvanīye vā bhikkhū sāyanhasamayaṁ kapilavatthuṁ pavisanto; ",
  "sn55.21:1.6": "bhantenapi hatthinā samāgacchāmi; ",
  "sn55.21:1.7": "bhantenapi assena samāgacchāmi; ",
  "sn55.21:1.8": "bhantenapi rathena samāgacchāmi; ",
  "sn55.21:1.9": "bhantenapi sakaṭena samāgacchāmi; ",
  "sn55.21:1.10": "bhantenapi purisena samāgacchāmi. ",
  "sn55.21:1.11": "Tassa mayhaṁ, bhante, tasmiṁ samaye mussateva bhagavantaṁ ārabbha sati, mussati dhammaṁ ārabbha sati, mussati saṅghaṁ ārabbha sati. ",
  "sn55.21:1.12": "Tassa mayhaṁ, bhante, evaṁ hoti: ",
  "sn55.21:1.13": "‘imamhi cāhaṁ samaye kālaṁ kareyyaṁ, kā mayhaṁ gati, ko abhisamparāyo’”ti? ",
  "sn55.21:2.1": "“Mā bhāyi, mahānāma, mā bhāyi, mahānāma. ",
  "sn55.21:2.2": "Apāpakaṁ te maraṇaṁ bhavissati apāpik�